{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"王阳明·major-works","stage":"DONE","category":"wang-yangming","categoryLabel":"王阳明","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.91,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/24_wang-yangming/4_major-works","introHtml":"<p>王阳明（1472—1529）本人极少著述，其思想主要靠门人辑录的语录与他亲笔的论学书信留存。本部分（主要著作）从「文本」这一独特视角切入心学——不直接讲「心即理」「致良知」讲了什么（那是<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">第三部分·思想与方法</a>的职责），而是讲这些思想<strong>装在哪些著作里、如何成书、如何阅读</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>本 hub（主要著作）</strong>：聚焦文本载体本身——《传习录》的成书与版本、论学书信的体例、《大学问》的纲领地位、四句教与天泉证道的文本与论定。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></strong>：著作背后的人生分期（龙场悟道、平乱、临终），是理解文本年代的背景。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></strong>：著作所承载的哲学命题的系统展开。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与传承</a></strong>：这些著作如何流传东亚、催生学派。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></strong>：围绕四句教「无善无恶」等文本的后世论争。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同一事实只在主篇展开：版本考据在<a href=\"instructions-for-practical-living/the-chuanxilu\">《传习录》：成书与版本</a>，四无/四有事件在<a href=\"four-axioms/the-tianquan-debate\">天泉证道</a>，余篇以相对路径交叉链接而不重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章与推荐学习路径\">三章与推荐学习路径</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>《传习录》</strong>：<a href=\"instructions-for-practical-living/the-chuanxilu\">成书与版本</a> → <a href=\"instructions-for-practical-living/recorded-dialogues\">内部结构与读法</a>——心学首要经典，先建立全局。</li>\n<li><strong>书信与essays</strong>：<a href=\"letters-and-essays/letters-on-learning\">论学书信与答顾东桥书</a> → <a href=\"letters-and-essays/the-inquiry-on-the-great-learning\">《大学问》</a>——系统辩护与晚年教典。</li>\n<li><strong>纲领</strong>：<a href=\"four-axioms/the-four-sentence-teaching\">四句教</a> → <a href=\"four-axioms/the-tianquan-debate\">天泉证道</a>——思想的凝练总结与争议。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置</strong>：读本部分前，建议先了解王阳明的<a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平分期</a>（尤其龙场悟道），因为著作的早/中/晚分期紧扣其人生际遇。无哲学基础者，可在读到具体命题时跳转<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>对照理解。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"instructions-for-practical-living","title":"Instructions For Practical Living","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/major-works/instructions-for-practical-living","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-chuanxilu","title":"《传习录》：成书、版本与文献地位","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/major-works/instructions-for-practical-living/the-chuanxilu"},{"seq":2,"slug":"recorded-dialogues","title":"《传习录》的内部结构与读法","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/major-works/instructions-for-practical-living/recorded-dialogues"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"letters-and-essays","title":"Letters And Essays","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/major-works/letters-and-essays","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"letters-on-learning","title":"论学书信与《答顾东桥书》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/major-works/letters-and-essays/letters-on-learning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-inquiry-on-the-great-learning","title":"《大学问》：王门的教典","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/major-works/letters-and-essays/the-inquiry-on-the-great-learning"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"four-axioms","title":"Four Axioms","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/major-works/four-axioms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-four-sentence-teaching","title":"四句教：心学的纲领性总结","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/major-works/four-axioms/the-four-sentence-teaching"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-tianquan-debate","title":"天泉证道：四句教的最后论定","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/major-works/four-axioms/the-tianquan-debate"}]}]}